          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shop for yours.\nHelp one waiting for theirs.",
            "text": "<p>We believe every pet deserves someone in their corner. That’s why PS4PETS is built to support pets and the people who love them — while helping shelter animals still waiting for their Forever Families.</p><p>♡ Shop for yours. Help one waiting for theirs.</p><p>♡ Every pet deserves someone in their corner.</p><p>♡ For Pets. For Families. For Those Still Waiting for Theirs.</p>",
            "asset": "none",
